<title>POLAND: Polish WKSM quarrier to start bourse trade Aug 11.</title>
<headline>Polish WKSM quarrier to start bourse trade Aug 11.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish granite and gravel quarrier Wroclawskie  Kopalnie Surowcow Mineralnych SA (WKSM) will start trade on the Warsaw  bourse's parallel market on August 11, a bourse deputy president said  on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;On August 11 WKSM will be traded for the first time on the parallel  market,&quot; Ryszard Czerniawski told reporters.</p>
<p>In June the treasury ministry allotted 132,950 shares in the firm  at 44.1 zlotys from a previous minimum price of 26 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
